    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Luxurious 4/5 Bedroom Detached Residence"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "12 Woodview Court is a splendid  property, freshly painted and refreshed.\r\nBeing one of 4 once-off houses, it offers privacy in spades, yet within walking distance of the vibrant Main street\r\nAccommodation consists of Kitchen/Dining/Sitting Room, Reception Room, Utility, Office, Bedroom, and Bathroom , on the ground floor..\r\nThe first floor 3 Bedrooms (1 ensuite ) Main Bathroom, and great Storage area.\r\nThe location is excellent, you are in the heart of West Cork and all its wonderful services and amenities.\r\nA bus service, second to none, on your doorstep\r\nNo Pets, No Smokers, please send references"
      }
